    and percentage Bonus Heal.\n\nEvery [Tick] seconds, deals [TickDamageHpPerc]
    of your Max Hp to enemies around you.\n\nOn reaching a Size of [SizeThreshold],
    becomes [Uncontrollable] - making your character immuned to CC.
